N5008 [temp.param]/7 + [temp.arg.nontype]/1: class-type non-type template
arguments built by constexpr constructors -- with several members, a
constructor body (a conditional swap), the same argument spelled twice
naming one specialization, distinct arguments naming distinct ones, use in
a class template and in a constant expression (static_assert folds).
Non-vacuous: the last assertion states a wrong value and must FAIL.
